{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116413168843145217", "3_2116413168906010625"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T06:13:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116413287042891859"], "id": "2116413287042891859", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 1820, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "卧槽 今天坐高铁 去西安，感觉车上接近一半是外国人！\n\n感觉不能盯着出海了，境内游相关服务也可以搞啊🤔\n\n📈 数据上的变化有多明显？ https://t.co/qrYSQC6P6J", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116413287042891859"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T06:00:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116409994765836455"], "id": "2116409994765836455", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 847, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116405414921384099", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "为期 28 天的耍猴 告一段落…？ https://t.co/6PqQuZFWeR", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116409994765836455"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116352924997861376"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:13:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116352948267860261"], "id": "2116352948267860261", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 771, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "感觉 北京西站 苍老了许多。 https://t.co/QmkqJYgdDw", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116352948267860261"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116335853354319872"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T01:06:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116335895863505216"], "id": "2116335895863505216", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 635, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116335506846032264", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "还好 还好 就 4 条被限流了… https://t.co/Z8nuYipR9p https://t.co/Qj3NwKahB6", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116335895863505216"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T01:04:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116335506846032264"], "id": "2116335506846032264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 844, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116262141745565826", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "什么😧？能查到自己是不是被限流了？ https://t.co/AzB8ECCN3f", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116335506846032264"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T23:54:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116317923639972264"], "id": "2116317923639972264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1325, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116190999638880333", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "干翻微信 #X直聘 https://t.co/DgBM7kq0Sm", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116317923639972264"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T13:38:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116162790574719267"], "id": "2116162790574719267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1079, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116107260166656167", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "1970 年代中期，美国康奈尔大学一位叫卡米塔·伍德（Carmita Wood）的女性长期被一位教授骚扰，最后辞了职。\n\n她去申请失业救济，要说明离职原因，却很难把经历说清楚，因为当时还没有“性骚扰”这个词。\n\n正是在那前后，一群女性为了描述这类经历，把这个词造了出来。 https://t.co/qEG5VhYfvf", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116162790574719267"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116159540056170496"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T13:25:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116159548604235896"], "id": "2116159548604235896", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 915, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "woc 笑死 dj 低空经济已经这样了嘛… https://t.co/1I1ZJzKcPj", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116159548604235896"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T09:57:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116107260166656167"], "id": "2116107260166656167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 2693, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116106168116650094", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "韩国社会学家张京燮提出的“压缩现代性”（compressed modernity）。\n\n意思是前现代、现代、后现代在同一代人身上同时发生。\n\n一个人可能童年在农村烧柴，青年进了互联网大厂，中年面对 AI 替代。三个时代的规则塞进一个人的一生，主观经验根本来不及消化。 https://t.co/zBS9ewZ4IN", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116107260166656167"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T09:53:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116106168116650094"], "id": "2116106168116650094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2384, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116098025043169432", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "昨天听一个社科播客，说我们 处于一个 “命名”时代。\n\n我们命名“优绩主义”、“原生家庭”、“NPD”、“薄肌”、“大分发时代”、“没死主义”... 来纠正我们主观世界和客观世界的时长。\n\n科技让客观世界的变化太快，把我们的主观世界落下好几十上百个时钟差，我们需要各种叙述来解释或者说描述这一切。 https://t.co/bgs3HYBrni", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116106168116650094"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T08:05:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116079091782934852"], "id": "2116079091782934852", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1046, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115813561079615715", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "不下牌桌，开心地玩。 https://t.co/USyBfoio9k", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116079091782934852"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116056847727865857"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T06:37:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116056929130922108"], "id": "2116056929130922108", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1102, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115990700185792630", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "一定一定记得去开账单告警，用 Cloudflare 的朋友！⚠️\n\n最好设置几个不同的预算档位，比如 50%、80%、100%，费用到了就发邮件提醒。\n\n尤其是跑 AI、Workers 或者有按量计费服务的，别等月底收到账单才发现费用超出预期 😭 https://t.co/SRayl5GqBY https://t.co/JVgsR0woT8", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116056929130922108"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T02:34:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115995684814103001"], "id": "2115995684814103001", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1082, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115849726927196226", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "好文，太实在了。\n\n“流量起来的时候，少写两个功能根本不碍事，把最宝贵的窗口期全搭进去当免费客服，才是真亏。” https://t.co/Lqg5ZBwZbP", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115995684814103001"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T02:25:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115993404261998829"], "id": "2115993404261998829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1101, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115729520112345423", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "为什么，这句话，\n才 10 来个互动，\n却可以 带来 3w 曝光？？！\n\n我不理解。 https://t.co/dBucUGDUAv", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115993404261998829"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115990777432244224"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:14:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115990779684631021"], "id": "2115990779684631021", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1131442257675083777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 157, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115990764631298366", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "如果你也想试试的话，可以下载或更新「网易邮箱大师」，接入常用邮箱后点击底部 AI 图标即可！Mail Agent 的手机端和桌面端都能用！\n\n除了这次试的查找、汇总和导出，网易邮箱介绍它还可以整理待办、生成周报，以及记录输出偏好，以及你能想到的更多邮箱操作！\n\n入口👉 https://t.co/tRUdsBa6wp https://t.co/W1iz4Pdbya", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115990779684631021"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115990761556832256"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:14:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115990764631298366"], "id": "2115990764631298366", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1131442257675083777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 168, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115990748638421204", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "还有一个我最近在用的超级痛的场景：Cloudflare 的账单预算提醒！⚠️\n\n我在 Cloudflare 里给账单设置了邮件通知，配置成费用达到设定阈值时发送邮件提醒。\n\n其中一条提醒发到我已接入邮箱大师的 Gmail，平时查看邮件时，可以一起留意这些账单提醒，避免等月底才发现费用超出预期。 https://t.co/hVgu9nPNZp", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115990764631298366"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115990745400442880"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:14:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115990748638421204"], "id": "2115990748638421204", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1131442257675083777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115990732423278617", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "整完发票，我又试了一个每天都会碰到的场景：\n\nSubstack 订阅太多，看不过来！😖\n\n我先让它找出最近 7 天的订阅邮件，最多列 5 篇，给标题、日期、原邮件入口和一句话摘要。\n\n后来又追问 AI 和开发相关内容，它列出了 8 https://t.co/2yfhgxRkW0", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115990748638421204"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115990729424334848"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:14:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115990732423278617"], "id": "2115990732423278617", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1131442257675083777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 103, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115990716451266593", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "最后得到了一份 12 行清单，还单独列出了疑似重复和待核实项。\n\n我在 QQ 邮箱里也查到过两封指向同一张票的通知，这种情况确实容易重复记录。\n\n接着在对话里输入「Excel」，它生成了表格。我先保存到手机打开看了一眼，表格在手机屏幕上不太好看全； https://t.co/R1GEzsdoZ5", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115990732423278617"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115990713561411584"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:14:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115990716451266593"], "id": "2115990716451266593", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1131442257675083777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 146, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115990700185792630", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "先在网易邮箱大师里接入 QQ 邮箱和 Gmail，点底部的 AI 图标，进入 Mail Agent，把范围选成「所有收件箱」。\n\n我用的指令可以直接改月份、改邮箱复制：\n\n「请查找 QQ 邮箱和 Gmail 在 2026 年 10 https://t.co/pmqAk9sN2X", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115990716451266593"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115990696872366081"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T02:14:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115990700185792630"], "id": "2115990700185792630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 6762, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 12, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "卧槽！又月底了，又是让人最头疼的整理发票的时候：\n\n乱七八糟的票散在不同邮箱里，要一个个找，\n有的邮件带附件，有的只有下载链接；\n同一张票可能收到两封通知，还得自己判断是不是重复，\n找到之后，还要再把信息填进表格给财务。\n\n昨天看到我从大学一直在用的网易邮箱大师出了 Mail Agent，拿自己的 https://t.co/rHk1u4M0gI", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115990700185792630"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T02:13:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115990512431984915"], "id": "2115990512431984915", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1014, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "产品：看看新版本功能，出个技术方案我们来排期～\n技术：好，我们来看看技术实现。\n分析技术实现，写完设计文档 ⏳\n\n技术：我们整体梳理了下，这块需要 2 周时间。\n产品：那不行，已经定了这个版本要周末发！\n技术：那不行，就砍一些功能？\n产品：那不行，版本不能延期！功能不能延后！\n技术：好吧 😑", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115990512431984915"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T02:06:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115988672751562894"], "id": "2115988672751562894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 810, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115647047332512094", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "不用担心 A/ 封号！\n\n让任意 Agent 都能一键做出Opus 5.5 一样视频效果的方法！⬇️ https://t.co/ziQ9nPcbFI", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115988672751562894"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T02:01:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115987527031198087"], "id": "2115987527031198087", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1061, "like